# The inference dependencies of the RVC reference environment (setup_reference.py, Linux x86-64),
# for the Python mise.toml pins. The earlier Python RVC runtime locked the same set in
# integrations/rvc/requirements.in, removed with it; numpy, scipy and praat-parselmouth are moved up
# to their first releases with Python 3.14 wheels. CPU PyTorch is installed from its own index first.
# Make the lock with:
#   uv pip compile --python-version 3.14 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --generate-hashes \
#       native/rvc-runtime/reference/requirements.in -o native/rvc-runtime/reference/requirements.lock
